  <item>
    <title>甲状腺结节到底要不要紧？三甲院长带你看懂B超单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a656d02a3fec224d5a35896</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a656d02a3fec224d5a35896</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 02:16:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑气旺盛、湿热交织，你是不是也感到烦躁失眠、浑身不得劲？甲状腺形似一只“蝴蝶结”，作为人体的内分泌与代谢总开关，对气温、情绪、作息、饮食变化极为敏感。哪些习惯正在悄悄损伤它？查出甲状腺结节怎么办？</span></p><p><span>本期《健康有方FM》邀请上海交通大学医学院附属新华医院院长蔡伟，结合临床实例，详解甲亢、甲减、桥本、甲状腺结节、甲状腺癌全类别病症，手把手教学居家自检，厘清术后服药、饮食养护误区。</span></p><p><span>《全民健康大讲堂》由上海市卫生健康委员会、上海申康医院发展中心、上海报业集团联合主办，上海市健康促进中心、澎湃新闻联合承办。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoSgylCOz0SUDV2SqOY0xjOatOHz.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a></span></strong><span>甲状腺长在哪？如何掌控全身代谢？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a></span></strong><span>甲亢、甲减、桥本、结节分别是什么病</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a></span></strong><span>这两类人最容易长甲状腺结节</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a></span></strong><span>甲状腺自检，先从摸对甲状腺开始</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a></span></strong><span>分清结节良恶，记住“五个好”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a></span></strong><span>B超单看不懂？拆解TI-RADS分级关键指标</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a></span></strong><span>查出结节不用慌，完整标准化诊疗三步流程</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a></span></strong><span>甲状腺癌是懒癌？不同分型恶性程度天差地别</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a></span></strong><span>细针穿刺、基因检测分别有什么作用？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a></span></strong><span>良性结节也要做手术？医生细说个体化手术标准</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a></span></strong><span>传统开放式vs腔镜，两种甲状腺手术利弊对比</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a></span></strong><span>复杂晚期甲状腺肿瘤，多学科联合诊疗好在哪</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2254">37:34</a></span></strong><span>2-3天就能出院？详解快速康复ERAS体系</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a></span></strong><span>身体差、肿瘤晚期无法手术，还有哪些治疗方案</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a></span></strong><span>术后多久复查一次？甲状腺患者饮食控碘细则</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a></span></strong><span>术后必须终身服药吗？停药标准一次性讲清</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2927">48:47</a></span></strong><span>夏天出汗多，甲状腺术后伤口如何护理不发炎</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2999">49:59</a></span></strong><span>网上散结方靠谱吗？存在肝肾损伤风险</span></p><blockquote><p><strong><span>相关图片</span></strong></p></blockquote><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiEs6xiy1wWjPzvp-jiVUgcLFScE.jpg" alt=""><blockquote><p><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>主播/雨菲</span></p><p><span>策划、监制、剪辑/徐婉</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
