    <itunes:duration>01:00:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9RXJhkiWQh08bZoslEmrrIWYpo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>白天立flag晚上破功，懒人减肥还有救吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a405cf09d2f5743683eddce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a405cf09d2f5743683eddce</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 00:06:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天来了，漂亮衣服和海边旅行都已经安排就绪，可你的身体准备好了吗？多少人曾下定决心要在夏天瘦下来，却在夜晚被小龙虾、冰饮打败。减重计划反复搁置，问题到底出在哪里？有没有一种不靠硬扛、能轻松坚持，又能见到长期效果的科学方法？</span></p><p><span>本期《健康有方FM》邀请复旦大学附属华东医院临床营养科主任吴江，上海市运动促进健康专家委员会副主任、“爱活力”创始人朱娴，从日常饮食、科学运动两大板块拆解减脂难题，给大家分享一套接地气、能长期坚持的减重实操方案。</span></p><p><span>《全民健康大讲堂》由上海市卫生健康委员会、上海申康医院发展中心、上海报业集团联合主办，上海市健康促进中心、澎湃新闻联合承办。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHSQ-bFqaxCjAWxdRtXDTyuDcWk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 一月瘦十斤可行？拒绝盲目减重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 速瘦易反弹，详解减重悠悠球效应</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 每日500大卡缺口，饮食运动搭配更轻松</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 苹果vs梨型身材，腹部脂肪危害更大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> BMI正常，也会内脏脂肪超标</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 体能越高，减脂效率越高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 两种肥胖区分：脂肪型肥胖&amp;隐形瘦胖子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> 211餐盘法则，懒人减脂不用算热量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">32:52</a> 调整吃饭顺序，轻松平稳控糖减脂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 极端节食会降低基础代谢，越减越难瘦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 1㎡居家碎片化运动，上班族无压力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 每周150分钟运动拆分，日均20分钟即可</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a> 三套新手跟练动作，单腿平衡+徒手深蹲+桌面俯卧撑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3386">56:26</a> 算出燃脂心率，杜绝无效运动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3752">01:02:32</a> 突破平台期关键：饮食运动增加多样性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3912">01:05:12</a> 区分生理饥饿与情绪性暴食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4224">01:10:24</a> 睡眠是减脂根基，熬夜直接阻碍掉秤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4386">01:13:06</a> 经常应酬怎么控体重？正餐做好预防管控</span></p><blockquote><p><strong><span>相关图片</span></strong></p></blockquote><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fusg4dn0KeNMTMPTksCujpA5qF9J.jpg" alt=""><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiJWlGXqK4AI3IEts19ExAPPt7zk.jpg" alt=""><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlO-C5q23dL3KMfleHBsGU1tcix5.png" alt=""><blockquote><p><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>主播/诗妍</span></p><p><span>剪辑/曾谙</span></p><p><span>策划、监制/徐婉</span></p>]]></description>
