  <item>
    <title>做对这几件事，你的睡眠还能救回来！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bd6ebd2d318777c9f0046d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bd6ebd2d318777c9f0046d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>昨晚，你睡好了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3月21日是世界睡眠日，今年中国的主题为“优质睡眠，美好生活”。可对许多人而言，一夜安睡早已成了一种奢望。我国超3亿人正受睡眠障碍困扰，入睡难、易醒、多梦、习惯性熬夜，早已成为生活常态。睡不好，不只是白天疲惫没精神，更是在悄悄透支着我们的身心健康。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们邀请上海市中医医院主任医师、中国睡眠研究会中医睡眠医学专业委员会主任委员许良，上海市同济医院精神医学科副主任医师、上海市医学会心身医学分会委员姚军，中西医专家联手，帮你把好睡眠一点点养回来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《全民健康大讲堂》由上海市卫生健康委员会、上海申康医院发展中心与上海报业集团联合主办，上海市健康促进中心、澎湃新闻联合承办。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0z916OtBeG_h_pUvDjVk1vFJ7p.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 睡眠障碍全解析：你属于哪一种？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 胃不和则卧不安：养好脾胃，睡眠自然稳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 错过就是熬夜！抓住23点-1点“元气觉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 从健忘到高血压，失眠正在悄悄拖垮你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 怕上瘾不敢吃？如何看待安眠药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 别把褪黑素当成安眠药！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> 职场人如何睡好觉？把压力挡在卧室外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 越焦虑越睡不着？学生党自救指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 老年人睡不好，不是年纪的错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 更年期遇上失眠：激素波动下的温柔调理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 打鼾≠睡得香！警惕睡眠呼吸暂停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 生物钟乱了？几个技巧拨正睡眠节律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2838">47:18</a> 科学午睡指南，告别越睡越累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2859">47:39</a> “478呼吸法”，快速进入深睡眠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> 不花钱的助眠法：梳头、散步、晒太阳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> 食疗安神：莲子百合汤请收好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">53:36</a> 睡前泡脚小技巧：头凉脚暖才好睡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a> 白噪音、灯光、温度这样调</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>制作团队</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>主播/王诗妍</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑/曾谙</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划、监制/徐婉</span></p>]]></description>
